    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A shaman-child wanders through a world destroyed by mankind, seeking a cure for his eternal wound. With the aid of a mystical drum, he must connect with a withering planet and purge the evil that controls humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>A Healer's Journey</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536020/extras/2b92313b8f867e75a78a8b5431d6c059.poster.avif?t=1752753854\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536020/extras/2b92313b8f867e75a78a8b5431d6c059.webm?t=1752753854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536020/extras/2b92313b8f867e75a78a8b5431d6c059.mp4?t=1752753854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since the dawn of time, humans have fought darkness with violence to no avail. Now, it\u2019s your turn to break the cycle, by purging the evil that controls humanity through shamanic healing. <br>Play songs on a mystical drum to cleanse aggression from those lost to greed. But beware: your enemies will not yield easily.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536020/extras/b2b38f932a6310d1ebfb1ea7d143fd7e.avif?t=1752753854\" data-has-big width=800 height=50 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Restore the Natural Balance</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536020/extras/c4e20b22c935917eaf800a0108b3bacd.poster.avif?t=1752753854\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536020/extras/c4e20b22c935917eaf800a0108b3bacd.webm?t=1752753854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536020/extras/c4e20b22c935917eaf800a0108b3bacd.mp4?t=1752753854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nature is on the brink of collapse, and yet, it still lends its infinite strength to those with pure hearts. Connect with the land, mend the wounds of the Earth, and witness its forgotten magic.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536020/extras/b2b38f932a6310d1ebfb1ea7d143fd7e.avif?t=1752753854\" data-has-big width=800 height=50 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Uncover Lost Knowledge</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536020/extras/97b1b83b5ecbd8f0f881246b36b2210a.poster.avif?t=1752753854\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536020/extras/97b1b83b5ecbd8f0f881246b36b2210a.webm?t=1752753854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536020/extras/97b1b83b5ecbd8f0f881246b36b2210a.mp4?t=1752753854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover an ancient book chronicling humanity\u2019s fall into darkness.  Solve cryptic puzzles designed to keep you from the truth. And commune with the spirits of Nature to find a cure for your eternal wound.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536020/extras/b2b38f932a6310d1ebfb1ea7d143fd7e.avif?t=1752753854\" data-has-big width=800 height=50 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A haunting dystopian world\u00a0</strong>where nature clashes against machines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense, rhythmic combat:</strong> tactically craft drum beat combinations to heal your foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss battles</strong>: confront humanity's darkest souls and restore their kindness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your shamanic powers</strong>: gather pollen from healed plants to enhance your abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An original soundtrack</strong>: composed by <i>1011</i>.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A shaman-child wanders through a world destroyed by mankind, seeking a cure for his eternal wound. With the aid of a mystical drum, he must connect with a withering planet and purge the evil that controls humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>A Healer's Journey</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536020/extras/2b92313b8f867e75a78a8b5431d6c059.poster.avif?t=1752753854\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536020/extras/2b92313b8f867e75a78a8b5431d6c059.webm?t=1752753854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536020/extras/2b92313b8f867e75a78a8b5431d6c059.mp4?t=1752753854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since the dawn of time, humans have fought darkness with violence to no avail. Now, it\u2019s your turn to break the cycle, by purging the evil that controls humanity through shamanic healing. <br>Play songs on a mystical drum to cleanse aggression from those lost to greed. But beware: your enemies will not yield easily.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536020/extras/b2b38f932a6310d1ebfb1ea7d143fd7e.avif?t=1752753854\" data-has-big width=800 height=50 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Restore the Natural Balance</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536020/extras/c4e20b22c935917eaf800a0108b3bacd.poster.avif?t=1752753854\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536020/extras/c4e20b22c935917eaf800a0108b3bacd.webm?t=1752753854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536020/extras/c4e20b22c935917eaf800a0108b3bacd.mp4?t=1752753854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nature is on the brink of collapse, and yet, it still lends its infinite strength to those with pure hearts. Connect with the land, mend the wounds of the Earth, and witness its forgotten magic.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536020/extras/b2b38f932a6310d1ebfb1ea7d143fd7e.avif?t=1752753854\" data-has-big width=800 height=50 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Uncover Lost Knowledge</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536020/extras/97b1b83b5ecbd8f0f881246b36b2210a.poster.avif?t=1752753854\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536020/extras/97b1b83b5ecbd8f0f881246b36b2210a.webm?t=1752753854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536020/extras/97b1b83b5ecbd8f0f881246b36b2210a.mp4?t=1752753854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover an ancient book chronicling humanity\u2019s fall into darkness.  Solve cryptic puzzles designed to keep you from the truth. And commune with the spirits of Nature to find a cure for your eternal wound.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3536020/extras/b2b38f932a6310d1ebfb1ea7d143fd7e.avif?t=1752753854\" data-has-big width=800 height=50 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A haunting dystopian world\u00a0</strong>where nature clashes against machines.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense, rhythmic combat:</strong> tactically craft drum beat combinations to heal your foes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss battles</strong>: confront humanity's darkest souls and restore their kindness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your shamanic powers</strong>: gather pollen from healed plants to enhance your abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An original soundtrack</strong>: composed by <i>1011</i>.</p></li></ul>",
